{"title":"Thanksgiving  Day ","startsAt":"2026-10-12T10:00:00-04:00","endsAt":"2026-10-12T18:30:00-04:00","status":"ACTIVE","type":"PHYSICAL","description":"Thanksgiving Day - **MON, OCT 12/26 Departs:** York Mills Subway Station at 9:15 am / Islington at 10:00 am. Enjoy a delicious hot Turkey lunch at Mrs. Mitchell’s. Then, enjoy a train ride onboard the South Simcoe Railway. You’ll travel in restored 1920s coaches over the rails of a century-old branch line that once connected Hamilton with Barrie and Collingwood. Enjoy the sights and sounds of the vintage locomotive as you travel through the rolling countryside. The round trip from Tottenham to Beeton is highlighted by the Conductor’s friendly and informative commentary. Experience travel as our ancestors did, and learn about the history of the railways that made Canada what it is today! Before heading home, enjoy a “Taste and Shop” experience at Magnotta Winery, which includes 4 wine tastings and browsing in their gift shop. RTA: 6:30 p.m. RATE: $160.00.\n\n**RESERVE YOUR SEAT ON MARY MORTON TOURS BY booking** on-**line at ,** https://www.marymortontours.com/ **or CALL (416) 488-2674. LET THEM KNOW YOU ARE WITH CINDY STEVENS GROUP.** WHEN YOU HAVE BOOKED YOUR TICKET LET ME KNOW IN COMMENTS BELOW. : )","venue":{"address":""},"fee":null,"group":"Toronto Seniors Social Club","image":"https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/6/8/5/highres_534901669.jpeg"}